## solution

#### using a counter

```cpp
#include <string>

bool pairedParentheses(std::string str) {
  int count = 0;
  for (char ch : str) {
    if (ch == '(') {
      count += 1;
    } else if (ch == ')') {
        if (count == 0) {
          return false;
        }
        count -= 1;
    }
  }
  return count == 0;
}
```

- n = length of string
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(1)
